    <bpmn:process id="W_W3881" name="W3881. CDP Strategy, Architecture &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Digital/data strategy (links to VS-28/VS-113); clienteling need (links to VS-124)
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: 1 enterprise CDP program
Owner: CDP / Data &amp; Analytics
Participants: CDP Team, Data &amp; Analytics (links to VS-28), Enterprise Architecture (links to VS-113), Marketing (links to VS-14), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), IT (links to VS-27), Privacy/DPO (links to VS-91), Security (links to VS-27.3), Key Account (links to VS-107), Finance (links to VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W3881 — CDP Strategy, Architecture &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3881_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3881_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3881_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3881_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3881_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3881_Lane2" name="CIO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3881_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3881_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3881_Start4" name="Digital/data strategy (links to VS-28/VS-113); clienteling need (links to VS-124)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3881_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3881_Task5" name="CDP/Data define the CDP strategy and architecture: the single-customer-view…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Data define the CDP strategy and architecture: the single-customer-view vision, source systems (POS/loyalty/ecommerce/trade/app/CX), the platform build-vs-buy decision, real-time vs batch activation, and alignment to enterprise data architecture (links to VS-113) and data warehouse (links to VS-28)
Responsible (R): CDP / Data / EA
Accountable (A): CIO / CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3881_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3881_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3881_Task6" name="CDP establish governance: CDP steering (Marketing, Loyalty, Ecommerce, Privacy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP establish governance: CDP steering (Marketing, Loyalty, Ecommerce, Privacy, IT), ownership of the golden record vs source masters (links to VS-29), consent authority (links to VS-91/W3885), data-sharing with partners, and KPIs (resolution rate, activation, CLV uplift, consent coverage)
Responsible (R): CDP / Data / Privacy
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3881_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3881_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3881_Task7" name="CIO/Executive ratify the strategy, approve the CDP budget (links to W3904), and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CIO/Executive ratify the strategy, approve the CDP budget (links to W3904), and cascade to consuming functions (Marketing links to VS-14, Loyalty links to VS-13, Key Account links to VS-107, Sales Enablement links to VS-124)
Responsible (R): CIO / CDP
Accountable (A): CEO / CMO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3881_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3881_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3881_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3881_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3881_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-146 (ensure consented single-customer-view governance.) | - operational: architecture review (links to VS-113); operational: CDP strategy and golden-record ownership
Owner: CDP / Data &amp; Analytics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
