    <bpmn:process id="W_W3882" name="W3882. Customer Data Ingestion &amp; Source-System Integration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Source event / batch cycle
Frequency: Near-real-time (POS/ecommerce events) + batch (nightly)
Volume: 2.8M POS txns/month + ~42,900 ecommerce orders/month + ~600K loyalty + trade/app/CX events
Owner: CDP / IT
Participants: CDP Team, IT/Data Engineering (links to VS-27/VS-28), EA (links to VS-113), POS (links to VS-08), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Trade/AR (links to VS-16/VS-11), Mobile App (links to VS-75), CX (links to VS-13), Privacy (links to VS-91)
Source: workflow W3882 — Customer Data Ingestion &amp; Source-System Integration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3882_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3882_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3882_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3882_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3882_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3882_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3882_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3882_Start3" name="Source event / batch cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3882_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3882_Task4" name="CDP/IT engineer ingestion from all customer-touching sources: POS (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/IT engineer ingestion from all customer-touching sources: POS (links to VS-08, near-real-time event stream), ecommerce (links to VS-10), loyalty engine (links to VS-13), trade/AR (links to VS-16/VS-11), mobile app (links to VS-75), CX/complaints (links to VS-13), marketing/email (links to VS-14), and service/installation (links to VS-12) — via the integration layer (links to VS-113/W257)
Responsible (R): CDP / Data Engineering / IT
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3882_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3882_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3882_Task5" name="CDP/Privacy ingest with lawful basis and consent tags attached at the point of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/Privacy ingest with lawful basis and consent tags attached at the point of ingestion (links to VS-91/W3885), apply minimization/pseudonymization where appropriate, and handle data-subject rights flags
Responsible (R): CDP / Privacy / IT
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3882_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3882_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3882_Task6" name="CDP/IT operate ingestion SLA, monitor pipeline health and data freshness (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/IT operate ingestion SLA, monitor pipeline health and data freshness (links to VS-27 W595/W614), and handle source-schema changes (links to VS-27.1/W616)
Responsible (R): CDP / IT
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3882_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3882_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3882_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3882_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
