        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-607 (ensure controlled execution — CDP Architecture, Ingestion &amp; Identity Resolution (PA-126.1).) | - operational: event-stream ingestion; operational: consent-at-ingestion control (links to VS-91)
Owner: CDP / IT</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
