        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/Marketing enforce consent at activation: suppress non-consented contacts from campaigns (links to VS-14/W1184), honor channel preferences and frequency caps, and support preference-center self-service (links to VS-75 app / VS-10 web)
Responsible (R): CDP / Marketing / IT
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
