Owner: CDP / Data Governance
Participants: CDP Team, Data Governance (links to VS-29/VS-28.2), Data Engineering (links to VS-27/VS-28), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Trade (links to VS-11/VS-16), Insights (links to VS-28.1)
