      <bpmn:userTask id="W3886_Task4" name="CDP/Data-Governance run continuous customer DQ: completeness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/Data-Governance run continuous customer DQ: completeness (email/phone/address), validity (format/Philippine-mobile/Postal), accuracy (NCOA-equivalent/bounce), uniqueness (deduplication links to W3883), and consistency (across sources), with DQ dashboards (links to VS-28.2/W734)
Responsible (R): CDP / Data Governance
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3886_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3886_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
