    <bpmn:process id="W_W3888" name="W3888. CDP Platform Operations, Security &amp; Access Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Platform lifecycle; access request; security event
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: 1 CDP platform; ~100–300 entitled users across functions
Owner: CDP / IT
Participants: CDP Team, IT (links to VS-27), Security (links to VS-27.3), Enterprise Architecture (links to VS-113), Privacy (links to VS-91), Vendor/Cloud (links to VS-27 W369), Finance (links to VS-17.4/FinOps W373)
Source: workflow W3888 — CDP Platform Operations, Security &amp; Access Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3888_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3888_Lane1" name="CDP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3888_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3888_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3888_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3888_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3888_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3888_Start3" name="Platform lifecycle; access request; security event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3888_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3888_Task4" name="CDP/IT operate the CDP platform: availability, performance, environment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CDP/IT operate the CDP platform: availability, performance, environment management (links to VS-27.2), backup/recovery (links to VS-27.2 W382), patch/release (links to VS-27.1 W495), and FinOps/cloud cost (links to VS-27.2 W373)
Responsible (R): CDP / IT
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3888_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3888_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3888_Task5" name="CDP/Security govern access: role-based access, least-privilege, quarterly…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CDP/Security govern access: role-based access, least-privilege, quarterly recertification (links to VS-27 W832/W1408), segregation of duties, field-level masking for sensitive attributes (links to VS-91), and PII encryption/tokenization
Responsible (R): CDP / Security / Privacy
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3888_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3888_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3888_Task6" name="CDP/Vendor manage the CDP SaaS/vendor contract (links to VS-34/VS-100.3), SLA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CDP/Vendor manage the CDP SaaS/vendor contract (links to VS-34/VS-100.3), SLA (links to VS-27 W369), and DPIA for vendor data-processing (links to VS-91/W389), and handle incident response (links to VS-27.3/W53)
Responsible (R): CDP / IT / Privacy / Legal
Accountable (A): CDP Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3888_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3888_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3888_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3888_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3888_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-146 (ensure consented single-customer-view governance.) | - operational: least-privilege and field masking (links to VS-91); operational: SLA and fallback
Owner: CDP / IT</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
